title: Bachmann BlueNet2: EMA GPIO contacts
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/power/bachmann
license: GPLv2
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 Monitors the single GPIO contacts of the EMA modules on the master of a
 Bachmann BlueNet2 PDU chain.

 The summary shows the BlueNet2 entity state of the contact only, mode and
 switch are in the details. The service is {CRIT} when the contact is
 {armed}, and when the contact reports a state of a missing or broken entity
 ({expected}, {lost}, {lostChild}, {errorHigh}, {errorLow}, {updateError}).
 It is {UNKNOWN} for {undefined} and {CRIT} when the contact vanished from
 the SNMP data. All other states are {OK}.

item:
 The name of the input followed by {/1} or {/2} for the first or the
 second GPIO module.

discovery:
 One service per GPIO contact whose mode is {enabled} or {s0}.
